@startuml BS-RB-001
' ============================================================
' BS-UC-001: Write Customer Review
' Source: derived directly from BS-UC-001 use case text.
' ICONIX rule: each numbered controller below corresponds to
' a sentence in the use case and will become a method on the
' sequence diagram (BS-SD-001) and a test case in the test plan.
'
' Basic Course (mirrors BS-UC-001):
'   1 | Customer clicks Write Review on Book Detail page
'     | System retrieves CustomerSession, confirms login
'   2 | (system) System displays Write Review page
'   3 | Customer enters review text + rating, clicks Send
'     | System validates review length and rating range
'   4 | System creates CustomerReview, queues it for moderation
'   5 | System displays Confirmation page
'
' Alternate A: Customer not logged in -> invoke Login UC
' Alternate B: Review too short       -> reject, redisplay form
' Alternate C: Review too long        -> reject, redisplay form
' Alternate D: Rating out of range    -> reject, redisplay form
' Alternate E: Book ID not found      -> show Book Not Found page
'
' ICONIX connection rules:
'   Actor    <-> Boundary             OK
'   Boundary <-> Controller           OK
'   Controller <-> Controller         OK
'   Controller <-> Entity             OK
' FORBIDDEN:
'   Actor      -> Controller/Entity   (must go via Boundary)
'   Boundary   -> Boundary            (must go via Controller)
'   Boundary   -> Entity              (must go via Controller)
'   Entity     -> Entity              (must go via Controller)
' ============================================================

left to right direction
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName "Helvetica"
skinparam ArrowColor #444444

' --- Actors ---
actor "Customer"  as Cust
actor "Moderator" as Mod

' --- Boundaries (screens / pages) ---
boundary "Book Detail page"      as BDPage
boundary "Write Review page"     as WRPage
boundary "Confirmation page"     as ConfPage
boundary "Book Not Found page"   as BNFPage
boundary "Login page"            as LoginPage

' --- Entities (domain objects from BS-UC-001) ---
entity "CustomerSession"      as CS
entity "Book"                 as Book
entity "CustomerReview"       as CR
entity "PendingReviewsQueue"  as Queue

' --- Controllers (one per logical system step in the UC) ---
control "Is user logged in?"        as IsLoggedIn
control "Display Write Review page" as DisplayWR
control "Load Book"                 as LoadBook
control "Is Book Review length OK?" as IsLengthOk
control "Is Rating in range?"       as IsRatingOk
control "Save CustomerReview"       as SaveReview
control "Add to Pending Queue"      as AddToQueue
control "Display Confirmation page" as DisplayConf

' --- Alternate-course controllers (highlighted pink) ---
control "Invoke Login"                  as InvokeLogin           #Pink
control "Display length error"          as DisplayLengthErr      #Pink
control "Display rating error"          as DisplayRatingErr      #Pink
control "Display Book Not Found page"   as DisplayBNF            #Pink

' ── Basic course wiring ──────────────────────────────────────
Cust         --> BDPage              : click Write Review
BDPage       --> IsLoggedIn
IsLoggedIn   --> CS                  : isLoggedIn?
IsLoggedIn   --> DisplayWR           : yes
DisplayWR    --> WRPage
WRPage       --> LoadBook
LoadBook     --> Book

Cust         --> WRPage              : enter text + rating, click Send
WRPage       --> IsLengthOk
IsLengthOk   --> IsRatingOk          : ok
IsRatingOk   --> SaveReview          : ok
SaveReview   --> CR                  : new(book, customer, text, rating)
SaveReview   --> AddToQueue
AddToQueue   --> Queue               : enqueue(review)
AddToQueue   --> DisplayConf
DisplayConf  --> ConfPage
ConfPage     --> Cust

' ── Alternate A: not logged in ──────────────────────────────
IsLoggedIn   --> InvokeLogin         : no
InvokeLogin  --> LoginPage
LoginPage    --> DisplayWR           : on success, return here

' ── Alternate B/C: review length out of bounds ─────────────
IsLengthOk         --> DisplayLengthErr  : too short / too long
DisplayLengthErr   --> WRPage            : redisplay with error

' ── Alternate D: rating out of range ───────────────────────
IsRatingOk         --> DisplayRatingErr  : not in [1..5]
DisplayRatingErr   --> WRPage            : redisplay with error

' ── Alternate E: book not found ────────────────────────────
LoadBook           --> DisplayBNF        : NotFoundException
DisplayBNF         --> BNFPage
BNFPage            --> Cust

' ── Downstream link to moderation ──────────────────────────
Queue              --> Mod               : (read by Moderate Customer Reviews UC)

note bottom
  Traceability:
    REQ:        BS-REQ-001
    UC:         BS-UC-001
    SD:         BS-SD-001 (each controller above becomes one or more messages)
    Test cases: BS-TC-001..BS-TC-004
end note

@enduml
